<title>FRANCE: Paris May cargo up 4.2 pct - ADP.</title>
<headline>Paris May cargo up 4.2 pct - ADP.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo imported and exported through the Paris airports, Charles de Gaulle and Orly, in May rose 4.2 percent to 91,012 tonnes, from May last year, Paris airport authority (ADP) figures showed.</p>
<p>January-May 1997 cargo traffic totalled 456,714 tonnes, an increase of 2.9 percent on the same period in 1996, the ADP added.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
